OL,3,AMore funding needed to boost
OL,4,Aconstruction jobs for young people,
OL,5,Ahousing boss says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA long-term plan and additional funding
OL,8,Fis needed to create more placements for
OL,9,Fyoung people within the construction
OL,10,Findustry, according to one housing
OL,11,Fassociation boss.
OL,13,FIwan Trefor Jones, chief executive at
OL,14,FAdra, said it was important that
OL,15,Forganisations worked together to make
OL,16,Fsure "that there are opportunities for
OL,17,Fyoung people".
OL,19,FAdra had seen a rise in demand in its
OL,20,Facademy scheme, with one of their
OL,21,Frecent openings attracting 108
OL,22,Fapplicants for only six positions.
